title: Shuffle Leadership
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs, shuffle_leadership
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer = 0 and difficulty >= 0
on-arrival: week_actions += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 8;
card-image: img/kmtshuffle.jpg
go-to: rm_main

Changing the leadership of the party is painful, but perhaps it is necessary to adapt to changing circumstances.

Removing advisors will increase dissent from their faction of the party, while selecting advisors will increase a faction's strength.

- @rm_main: Remove advisors
- @add_advisors: Add advisors
- @remove_none: Don't change advisors.
- @easy_discard


###################### removing leaders

@rm_main
title: Remove advisors.
tags: center_advisor, left_advisor, right_advisor, center_left_advisor, whampoa_advisor, nonfactional_advisor 
frequency: 1

- #remove_advisor
- @add_advisors: Add advisors

@remove_none
title: Stop changing advisors.
go-to: main
tags: remove_advisor

@remove_tanyankai
title: Remove Tan Yankai
view-if: tanyankai_advisor = 1
tags: remove_advisor
on-arrival: tanyankai_advisor = 0; center_dissent += 5; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: rm_main

Tan Yankai has been removed as an advisor. The Centrist faction disapproves.

@remove_sunyatsen
title: Remove Sun Yat-sen
view-if: sunyatsen_advisor = 1
tags: remove_advisor
on-arrival: sunyatsen_advisor = 0; center_dissent += 10; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: rm_main

Sun Yat-sen has been removed as an advisor. The Centrist faction disapproves.

