####################### adding advisors

@add_advisors
title: Add advisors
choose-if: n_advisors < 3
unavailable-subtitle: Maximum of 3 advisors.
go-to: advisor_menu

@advisor_menu
title: Add other advisors.
tags: center_advisor, left_advisor, right_advisor, center_left_advisor, whampoa_advisor, nonfactional_advisor
frequency: 1


- @centrist: Add Centrists
- @left: Add Communists
- @right: Add Rightists
- @center_left: Add Leftists
- @whampoa: Add Whampoa Officers
- @nonfactional: Add non-factional advisors
- @rm_main: Remove advisors instead.
- @remove_none: Stop changing advisors.

@centrist
view-if: n_advisors < 3 [? if whampoa_built > 0 : n_advisors < 4 ?]

- #center_advisor

@right
view-if: n_advisors < 3 [? if whampoa_built > 0 : n_advisors < 4 ?]

- #right_advisor

@left
view-if: n_advisors < 3 [? if whampoa_built > 0 : n_advisors < 4 ?]

- #left_advisor

@center_left
view-if: n_advisors < 3 [? if whampoa_built > 0 : n_advisors < 4 ?]

- #center_left_advisor

@whampoa
view-if: whampoa_built > 0 and n_advisors < 4 

- #whampoa_advisor

@nonfactional
view-if: n_advisors < 3 [? if whampoa_built > 0 : n_advisors < 4 ?]

- #nonfactional_advisor

@add_tanyankai
title: Tan Yankai
subtitle: Tan Yankai is a statesman and organizer within the party. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions -  Clear the Agenda, Party Discipline, Emergency Fundraising ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/TanYankai.jpg
tags: center_advisor
view-if: tanyankai_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: tanyankai_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Tan Yankai is now an advisor.

@add_sunyatsen
title: Sun Yat-sen
subtitle: Sun Yat-sen is the father of our party and our nation. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Party Mediation, National Revolutionary Army, International Relations ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/SunYat-sen.jpg
tags: center_advisor
view-if: sunyatsen_advisor = 0 and sunyatsen_dead = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and centrists_resign = 0
on-arrival: sunyatsen_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Sun Yat-sen is now an advisor.

